# Local dev (dashboard + API)

Run **both** processes — the dashboard on :5173 proxies `/api` to the backend on :3000.
If only Vite is running, every API call fails (503/500).

```powershell
# Terminal 1 — API (port 3000)
cd server-node
npm run dev

# Terminal 2 — Dashboard (port 5173)
cd server-node/dashboard
npm run dev
```

One-time / after pull:

```powershell
cd server-node
npm run migrate
```

Login: **admin** / **ChangeMe123!00**

Agent (optional):

```powershell
cd agent-csharp
dotnet run --project src\EDR.Agent.Service\EDR.Agent.Service.csproj -- --console
```
